# P1 (size) swept up and back down on a saw with some shimmer, then jumped: the tank delays glide (at most 1/8 sample
# per sample) and the output taps crossfade in steps, so the tail bends but never clicks. The top of P1 is endless;
# the limiter holds it below 0 dBFS.
tempo 120
steps 64
tail 1
track fx2
input saw 110 0.5
preset 0 120 0 0 255 0 0 0 128 0 128 255 0 0 0 0 0 0
sweep p1 0 255 4 20
sweep p1 255 0 36 40
param p1 180 48
gain 1
expect sound 0 64
expect peak_below -0.5
